OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA showery morning, with a few
OL,6,Fheavy or thundery downpours possible.
OL,7,FShowers should ease this afternoon as
OL,8,Fhigh pressure builds in, allowing
OL,9,Fbrighter spells to develop.
OL,10,FTemperatures near average.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FAny remaining showers will
OL,13,Fsoon fade this evening, leaving a dry
OL,14,Fnight with clear spells. It will stay
OL,15,Fmild, with a few mist patches
OL,16,Fdeveloping.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
