OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FTuesday will start largely
OL,6,Fdry and bright, but cloud will
OL,7,Fincrease towards lunchtime. A few
OL,8,Fshowers are expected by the afternoon,
OL,9,Fthough some areas should stay dry.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,12,FChangeable through midweek, with rain
OL,13,Fcrossing Wales on Wednesday and
OL,14,Ffurther rain likely later Thursday.
OL,15,FFriday should turn drier and brighter,
OL,16,Fwith temperatures near average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
